        "text": "Appointed to the Cook County Circuit Court in May 2025, Lester Finkle serves in the Domestic Violence Division. He was an assistant public defender from 1984 to 2021, presenting more than 50 oral arguments before the Illinois Supreme and Appellate courts. He practiced appellate law at Quintairos, Prieto, Wood & Boyer from 2022 to 2025. Since 1997, he has taught at the University of Illinois Chicago School of Law.",
